<h3><u>Karbal ke jaane wale</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><span data-ft=""{""tn"":""K""}"" class=""userContent"">karbal ke jane wale jab karbala pahuchna<br> mazlume karbala se mera salam kehna<br> <br> kehna ke mere dil me<br> bus itni arzu hai<br> maula tumhare dar par<br> aane ki justuju hai<br> tum ho imame aali<span class=""text_exposed_show""><br> aur mai hu ek sawali<br> aka tumhare dar se<br> koi fira na khaali<br> kabse pukarta hu<br> dedo mujhe sahara<br> har simt behre ghum hai<br> milta nahi kinara<br> <br> is dehre bewafa me<br> beyaaro benisha hu<br> bezaar zindagi hu <br> begaanae jahaan hu<br> armaan kuch nahi hai  <br> bus ek dua hai lab par<br> sab hasrate bhula kar<br> aankho me ashq bhar kar<br> faryaad kar raha hai<br> ek ranjo gam ka maara<br> ehle aza hu mai bhi<br> ghumkhwaar hu tumhaara<br> <br> apna hai kaun kisko<br> mai haale ghum sunaau<br> hu mustarif kaha se<br> taskeene kalb laau<br> bechain ho raha hu<br> mujhko karaar dedo<br> ashko ke waste se<br> ghum ki bahar dedo<br> gham aakhri ho mera<br> maidaane karbala me<br> so jaau rote rote<br> gehra rahe kaza me<br> <br> roze ki jaliyo se<br> karna dua lipatkar<br> rakh dena thokaro me<br> unki mera muqaddar<br> jis waqt multaji ho<br> tu shahe do jahan se<br> us waqt meri haajat<br> likh le teri zabaan se<br> sabke naseeb me ho<br> haasil teri dua ka<br> karbobala hai markaz har sahibe aza ka<br> <br> shehre musafirane<br> rahe khuda wahi hai<br> yasrab se jo gaya tha<br> woh kafila wahi hai<br> jaan deke kar gae wo<br> nusrat shahe huda ki<br> kabre hai us zamin me<br> ansare bawafa ki<br> karna hai pesh tujhko<br> har bekafan ka pursa<br> paamaale zulme aada ibne hasan ka pursa<br> <br> sahil pe alkama ke<br> bhai zarur jana<br> abbas bawafa ka<br> pursa wahi pe dena<br> fir sue kabre akbar<br> jana bade adab se<br> milti thi jiski surat<br> shakle shahe arab se<br> zainab ke ladlo ka<br> pursa zarur dena<br> tar apne ansuo se<br> asgar ki kabr karna<br> <br> maqtal se karbala ki<br> khake shifa utha ke<br> ek maa ko pursa dena<br> furde nasheb jake<br> usdam nazar me hoga<br> aashur ka jo manzar <br> behal ranjo gam se<br> khudko wahi girakar<br> khidmat me sayyada ki<br> zaro kataar rona<br> unka shareeke maatam meri taraf se hona<br> <br> har pal tere safar ka<br> ab kamyab hoga<br> jo kaam tu karega<br> kaare sawaab hoga<br> aakhir me dastbasta<br> ek ilteja hai meri<br> ai karbala ke zaaer<br> jab wapsi ho teri<br> us waqt yaad rakhna <br> hargiz na bhul jana<br> mera kafan waha se<br> lekar zarur aana<br> <br> us din ke muntazir hai<br> kabse kalimo meesum<br> karbobala pahuchkar<br> yeh bhi kare muharram<br> seene pe daste matam<br> ashko se ankh tar ho<br> ehsase ghum ki had se<br> har saas ka guzar ho<br> nauha zabaan par ho<br> mazlume karbala ka<br> sad hai waa shahida<br> sad hai waa hussainaa</span></span></p>
               
                
                                
           

            	